{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "4ae6ed0c1adee40a3a69f4d812e5dca4c80a26c3471b8faeff2c1ffbed21f9d4", "ja": "シースーよりもレスファミで！", "zh": "比起吃寿司更想去家庭餐厅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "27e4b4f5a5f476fa287e897c5fad5ad6fe2cc35def42c3b988e1a634f66f4eb6", "ja": "BOT公演は大成功！　意外と仕事がデキる\n番組Dにもらったお食事券で、ファミレスに\nやってきたメンバー。お互いまだ知らない事\nが結構あると気付いた3人は、「これから\nもっと知っていこう」と語り合うのだった。", "zh": "BOT公演大获成功！成员们拿着意外能干的\n节目导演给的就餐券，来到了家庭餐厅。\n注意到彼此之间还有很多不了解的事后，\n3人互相谈心，表示“今后要多去了解彼此”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "19c7314d2375da5a73dcdc1c4134fdaabbfa20402f7e2811617e39d653439266", "ja": "（短期特番のお陰もあって、BOTは\n相当な盛り上がりを見せている。やったぞ！）", "zh": "（多亏了短期特别节目，BOT现在正掀起相当大的热潮。成功了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "066ab2f25db39c89381a7c253e7c09840f2d49786e7149f4e32d2d60253ff105", "ja": "（今日は、公演の打ち上げにやってきた。\nひとまず、みんなを労うとしよう）", "zh": "（今天来参加公演后的庆功宴。\n总之，先慰劳一下大家吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "2bf16265f3c270c39d2ac3904f727c16d1cb8a6e7c6d47827042e515e7f98bab", "ja": "今日はなに頼んでもいい、って……マジ！？\n{$P$}、無理してない？", "zh": "今天想点什么都可以……真的吗！？\n{$P$}，你没勉强自己吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a3335b52121b08b022f5017d0389b26f2c2a7cbaffb58e571cd164de556b9119", "ja": "いや、例のTV局のディレクターさんが、お食事券を\nたくさんくれたんだ。だから本当に何の心配もないよ。", "zh": "不，是之前那家电视台的导演给了我\n好多餐券。所以真的什么都不用担心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "071bc086bd737a7f8c3cf0785a63b31f2b7424e1bf27a81389ca9a74787abaf8", "ja": "ディレクターさんって、あの独特な\n話し方をされていた人ですか……？", "zh": "您说的导演先生，就是那位说话方式很独特的人吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "41dfd0a9f59d13c0382f77afec14f7c408dec2cadf6b8eeeae2c990bb92089b1", "ja": "ああ、「昔はザギンでシースーいけたんスけどね、\n今はウチもシュリンクでローコスのターンでして」", "zh": "啊，以前在银座吃寿司还是吃得起的，不过现在我们这边也进入收缩、走低成本路线的阶段了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "31f5a0652d874ed8aff21dafe5b64bbd2a24da7e9f84c393b9d6f45aaeca3e6d", "ja": "「まあレスファミのニューメも最近はマイウーです\nから、アリよりのアリすわ！　どぞどぞ」だそうだ。", "zh": "“不过，最近连家庭餐厅的菜单也很好吃，所以绝对可以！请请！”——据说是这么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "ae36f734d16cfc12fab5d5d81e5ef6d19caf090db94adf3a46b345cfb9d16254", "ja": "おおっ、太っ腹だね！　わかってたよ茜ちゃん、\nあのDはやり手だと……最初から見抜いてたよ！", "zh": "哇，真大方！我早就看出来了，小茜，那个D是个能干的人……一开始我就看穿了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "79be72411e407a8def4680b9a2d4b552d20eb86addf6e25a3ac68e22042eeeb5", "ja": "そうだな。クセは強いけど、仕事のデキる人だった。\nとにかくそういう訳だから、遠慮しなくていいぞ！", "zh": "是啊。虽然个性很强，但确实是个工作能力很强的人。\n总之就是这么回事，不用客气，尽管放开来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "523813efffe35a2e508e56cfe67bcaa9bc41ce865d4c439e863b895b587bb1e1", "ja": "やっぱ、ファミレスって落ち着くな～♪\nアタシにとっては、第二の家って感じ……♪", "zh": "果然还是家庭餐厅让人放松啊～♪\n对我来说，就像是第二个家一样……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "fa870a6fbf15689c4292f9d3b6006c6ef46c0c4f70d5f2d7d14a16ef4c4a09ac", "ja": "最近は、パフェとかスイーツもこだわってるよね～。\nやっぱJKは、ファミレスでダベらないと♪", "zh": "最近连芭菲啊甜点啊也越来越讲究了呢～。\n果然JK就得在家庭餐厅聊天才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "881427e447b2a4568017454d769e361da3f775a1255d93b807d9bc899c4e45b3", "ja": "ファミレスかぁ。私、こういうのもあんまり\nなかったかも？　友達とのんびりお喋りみたいな……。", "zh": "家庭餐厅啊。我好像也很少有过这种经历？和朋友悠闲地聊天之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "2b9a1a24a97666c7467e2f8e09a19eaed9c3307336bedda153069ba37b410985", "ja": "そうなの？　でも、アタシたちと\n仕事終わりの打ち上げはよくしてるよね？", "zh": "是吗？不过，我们不是经常在工作结束后一起庆祝吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "4eaa0095b02200b597d231e31169d8389fd3a60f00926c379cb43071a677f743", "ja": "あ、うん。\n今は、アイドルになれたから……。", "zh": "啊，嗯。\n因为现在已经成为偶像了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "bd839f95b92cc971fe3af29eb26584269b84ec9d0d7122d9399463a49f1df7b0", "ja": "デビュー前は、学校が終わったらレッスンして、\nオーディションの準備して。そればっかりだったな。", "zh": "出道前，放学后就去上课，准备试镜。那时候整天都在忙这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "1c4d9a7a4e58037e4c2d91ca6428a2576eba39a7445fca8a9d2c0c94c20af4e6", "ja": "アイドルになって生活が変わった、ってコトだね！\n人によっては、住む場所が変わったりするんだもんね。", "zh": "也就是说，成为偶像后，生活发生了变化呢！\n毕竟对有些人来说，连居住的地方都会改变嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "16f77b9e34c9ecfe64e205dba521ef716bae089358caa73fe545a88d6dc8994c", "ja": "けどそう考えてみると、意外とお互い、\n知らないコトが多いのかもなー。", "zh": "不过这么一想，或许我们彼此之间，还有很多意外不了解的事情呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "2175fa04570434306966aeb93caae767d002b016075c073414f3dcce834cb944", "ja": "それは、むしろこれからの\n楽しみって捉えるべきじゃない？", "zh": "不如把那当成今后的乐趣，不是更好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "94a4a22a82d57bb1bab390144b438adc1be0d023b31f17dfbc5625a2f4f7e7ff", "ja": "知らなかった個性とか魅力とか、\n「まだあるんだ！」ってカンジでね？　にゃはは♪", "zh": "不了解的个性啊、魅力啊，\n感觉就像\"原来还有这些！\"嘛？　呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "4917c85fd8f42b4c54332ea76394bc90b28e4b435f1e613fe950c4b56bf7687c", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだね！　みんなのことも知りたいし……\n学校の友達のことも、もっと知りたいな。", "zh": "呵呵，说得也是！我也想了解大家，还想更了解学校里的朋友们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "60e91b37bab3365dec51de8d2a12efd7a1a47e7256de616ea6411a1bf0256a71", "ja": "アイドルの青春も、普通の女子高生としての青春も、\nどっちもちゃんと追いかけたいなぁって。", "zh": "偶像的青春，以及作为普通女高中生的青春，我都想好好追逐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0c05908ef346874ffad07cfbcccf976e6a3d4b6ac69eed2f8e2ae6c649cca595", "ja": "そうだな！　それがいい。\nどっちかだけである必要なんて、どこにもないし。", "zh": "是啊！那样最好。\n没必要非得只选其中一边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "18ad1af53857a5ab93b41d7fa5c49b3ddcdff29543fdd10d312f14b2466fdedd", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}ちゃん！\nお食事券、まだたくさんあるんだよネ？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}！餐券还有很多张吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "3ac0e2007319d4039ada50d9828a23693b821ff649be02c5fb21c01ad0a55a99", "ja": "だったら、茜ちゃんにも1枚ちょうだい！\n友達と行きたいから♪", "zh": "既然这样，也给小茜也来1张吧！\n因为我想和朋友一起去♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "d8834f03783207c0f99c1045c68efae37d3e143733d465a1423bda0cd812d06a", "ja": "あ、それいいね！？　アタシも欲しいかも！", "zh": "啊，这个不错！？我可能也想要一张！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "03e367579e8ea27103bdd808dd3b70a9a556b1198adcedfd0dbb9c974772c535", "ja": "ああ、たくさんあるからな。紗代子もいるか？", "zh": "啊，毕竟有很多。纱代子也要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "e7bdc5d883eb52b8bdbff6d57e2423e1afad90d19cc73183f8a4ed595fa595da", "ja": "いいんですか？　それなら、私ももらおうかな。\nみんなを誘って……。", "zh": "可以吗？那我也拿一点好了。\n叫上大家一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "266e86cab21d7ba9cb71ce18cfda7c0b0c35c30bef161cd804c7191621959786", "ja": "もちろん、いいぞ。\n好きなだけどうぞ！", "zh": "当然可以。\n想拿多少就拿多少！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "39553be0f8a0a16238d360396cb85cd7274fcdf24640482789633a70751570df", "ja": "（……と、さすがに全部なくなってしまったか。\nまあいいや、元々自腹のつもりだったし）", "zh": "（……果然全都没了啊。算了，反正本来就打算自掏腰包的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0406_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0406_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "ca126a1bb5fcae2667fd3701392d8df0b562d69598043ff337f7487cb7f6e035", "ja": "（みんなの青春の後押しになるなら安いもんだ。\nリフレッシュして、次のBOTに挑もう！）", "zh": "（只要能为大家的青春助一臂之力，这点钱花得就值。休整一下，再向下一个BOT挑战吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
